                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a5ae18b8-b69d-3930-8fe1-18a39f4de17f",
                        "entry_id": "0402be2c-f188-3e8f-8a90-8cf559ed5c54",
                        "glosses": [
                            "underground, subterranean"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "09e85316-5db2-4597-8892-039b2f2ff961",
                                "sense_id": "a5ae18b8-b69d-3930-8fe1-18a39f4de17f",
                                "text": "Then he saw a sort of grey phosphorescence about, and guessed they were coming even to that inner world of subterrene horror of which dim legends tell, and which is litten only by the pale death-fire wherewith reeks the ghoulish air and the primal mists of the pits at earth’s core."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "476dc20f-098b-3ddd-98f1-43b1aef985d9",
                "word": "subterrene",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2396fd9a-1fa5-4b21-9505-be75395e7199",
                        "entry_id": "476dc20f-098b-3ddd-98f1-43b1aef985d9",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "subterrenes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a562b3d3-db68-34f3-a4cf-c26740d9372c",
                        "entry_id": "476dc20f-098b-3ddd-98f1-43b1aef985d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A machine for drilling or tunneling underground."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fbfd6e6-5dbc-4970-8c02-9a6ed6f7f7bf",
                                "sense_id": "a562b3d3-db68-34f3-a4cf-c26740d9372c",
                                "text": "With a deafening screech of metal upon rock—which surely must echo through all the recesses of the Mountain, and waken all its nightmare brood!—the subterrene smashed through the wall and came to rest beside them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f3fb6e4-808c-4732-90e1-c6b53991cf13",
                                "sense_id": "a562b3d3-db68-34f3-a4cf-c26740d9372c",
                                "text": "In the first field tests, a series of holes 2 inches in diameter and 12 feet deep were sunk with the rock-melting device, or subterrene."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0637015b-4aaf-4f19-b902-3859368c1392",
                                "sense_id": "a562b3d3-db68-34f3-a4cf-c26740d9372c",
                                "text": "… “The beauty of the Subterrene is that, as it burrows through the rock hundreds of feet below the surface, it heats whatever stone it encounters into molten rock, or magma, which cools after the Subterrene has moved on. …"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4ed7450f-87e1-4e4b-be73-b54455bcaa51",
                        "source_entry_id": "476dc20f-098b-3ddd-98f1-43b1aef985d9",
                        "source_sense_id": "a562b3d3-db68-34f3-a4cf-c26740d9372c",
                        "source_sense_description": "a machine for drilling or tunneling underground",
                        "target_lang_word": "подзе́мная ло́дка",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "подзе́мная ло́дка",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f1f0890-2f46-3139-904c-450aea9a53ed",
                                        "entry_id": "f0ac3fbe-7ab6-3c3a-9996-c4205aa03aa8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "гипотетическая самодвижущаяся машина, способная самостоятельно прокладывать себе путь под землёй"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "005e7ecc-b2ea-4675-8141-c61739c93f6d",
                                                "sense_id": "9f1f0890-2f46-3139-904c-450aea9a53ed",
                                                "text": "Подземная лодка будет похожа на крота, ― продолжил бы беседу Вадим Охотников. ― Резцы из крепчайшего сплава, расположенные впереди корпуса в виде венца, разрыхляют породу, превращая ее в мелкий песок."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
